---
import '../styles/flagship-case-study.css';
import { siteContent } from '../data/siteContent';
const { featuredProject: app, aeoExperiment: experiment } = siteContent;
const metrics=[['Prompt set',experiment.baseline.promptSet],['ChatGPT mentions',experiment.baseline.mentions],['AI visibility',experiment.baseline.visibilityRate],['Citation rate',experiment.baseline.citationRate]];
---
<article class="flagship-story" aria-labelledby="flagship-title">
  <header class="flagship-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Case study</p><h3 id="flagship-title">Sew What’s Next</h3></div><p>One product, two connected stages: first I built an AI-powered tool around a real maker problem. Now I’m using it to test how new products become visible in AI search.</p></header>
  <section class="story-phase build-phase" aria-labelledby="build-title">
    <div class="phase-copy"><p class="phase-label"><span>01</span> Build the product</p><h4 id="build-title">An AI sewing companion that turns possibility into a next project.</h4><p>{app.description}</p><p>{app.userStory}</p><ul role="list">{app.features.map(feature=><li>{feature}</li>)}</ul><a class="button primary" href={app.link} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open app <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div>
    <div class="phase-visual"><div class="browser-top" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>sew-whats-next</span></div><img src={app.image} alt="Sew What’s Next dashboard showing project filters and a recommended shirt dress pattern" loading="lazy"/></div>
  </section>
  <div class="story-bridge"><p class="story-bridge-label">Next question</p><p>Once the product was live, I asked a second question: <strong>could a new niche app become visible in AI-generated answers?</strong></p></div>
  <section class="story-phase experiment-phase" id="ai-search-lab" aria-labelledby="experiment-title">
    <div class="phase-copy"><p class="phase-label"><span>02</span> Measure discoverability</p><div class="experiment-status"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Baseline established · Experiment active</div><h4 id="experiment-title">{experiment.title}</h4><p>{experiment.description}</p><p class="phase-process">{experiment.process}</p><a class="button primary" href={experiment.url}>View experiment <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <section class="phase-scorecard" aria-label="Experiment baseline scorecard"><div class="scorecard-top"><span>Baseline scorecard</span><span>{experiment.baseline.date}</span></div><dl class="story-metrics">{metrics.map(([label,value])=><div><dt>{label}</dt><dd>{value}</dd></div>)}</dl><p>Model tested: <strong>{experiment.baseline.model}</strong></p></section>
  </section>
</article>
